 "_comment": "The data_quality values the server and every SDK must treat the same way. as_of: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS, then optionally a dot and 1 to 9 digits, then Z or +HH:MM or -HH:MM, with ASCII digits only, a real calendar date, hours 00 to 23, minutes and seconds 00 to 59 and an offset of at most 23:59; an empty as_of is a time left out, not one of these. check_name: a name is refused when it is longer than 100 bytes of UTF-8 or holds nothing but the space characters Go's strings.TrimSpace removes (tab, newline, vertical tab, form feed, carriage return, space, U+0085, U+00A0, U+1680, U+2000 to U+200A, U+2028, U+2029, U+202F, U+205F, U+3000). U+FEFF and U+001C to U+001F are not among them. Copies are byte for byte (scripts/shared-code.json).",
